      "description": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "value": "Frozen mechanical fixture for conversation threads driven by the player's continuation prompts. One Prompter carries a four-beat thread about the shortfall to its conclusion; each of the four prompt forms advances exactly one beat, and the conclusion gates the ledger topic's second line. The Archive turns the day so a parked thread can be resumed across a day boundary."
